      "name": "SortForSaving",
      "category": "ARFilter",
      "signature": "SortForSaving(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FARFilter*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Sort the structures (e.g. PackageNames) on this filter to be deterministic for saving the structure during\ncooking. This is also required for correctness of operator== when comparing the order-independent arrays."
